// The complete lifecycle spine (ADR-230 D4, upgrade seam 2): every committed
// relationship transition publishes exactly one of these events through the
// sharing outbox, written in the SAME transaction as the state change. The
// spine is verbatim the feed a future graph projector replays (Neo4j
